WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:05.238
Emmy started taking violin lessons.

2
00:00:05.239 --> 00:00:12.757
She practiced every day.

3
00:00:12.758 --> 00:00:16.509
Harry groaned.

4
00:00:16.510 --> 00:00:20.478
"You play the same song again and again!"

5
00:00:20.479 --> 00:00:25.345
"I have to learn this song," Emmy said.

6
00:00:25.346 --> 00:00:30.703
"I have a recital in two weeks!"

7
00:00:30.704 --> 00:00:32.868
Emmy kept practicing.

8
00:00:32.869 --> 00:00:40.242
Sometimes the song sounded loud.

9
00:00:40.243 --> 00:00:45.552
Sometimes it sounded squeaky.

10
00:00:45.553 --> 00:00:51.954
Sometimes it just sounded awful!

11
00:00:51.955 --> 00:00:56.907
When Emmy practiced, Oliver plugged his ears.

12
00:00:56.908 --> 00:01:02.102
Harry put a pillow over his head.

13
00:01:02.103 --> 00:01:09.022
Aunt Judy went for a walk.

14
00:01:09.023 --> 00:01:16.263
Emmy practiced and practiced.

15
00:01:16.264 --> 00:01:21.216
The song started to sound better.

16
00:01:21.217 --> 00:01:24.847
"I think I'm learning it!" she said.

17
00:01:24.848 --> 00:01:28.790
The recital finally came.

18
00:01:28.791 --> 00:01:33.607
Kids played many different instruments.

19
00:01:33.608 --> 00:01:40.373
A boy played the piano. A

20
00:01:40.374 --> 00:01:46.667
girl played the drums.

21
00:01:46.668 --> 00:01:49.893
"Wow!" Harry said.

22
00:01:49.894 --> 00:01:55.910
"Those drums sound awesome!"

23
00:01:55.911 --> 00:02:00.065
"The kids practiced a lot," said Dad.

24
00:02:00.066 --> 00:02:03.100
"That's why the music sounds good."

25
00:02:03.101 --> 00:02:05.390
Harry nodded.

26
00:02:05.391 --> 00:02:09.992
"I guess musicians have to practice!"

27
00:02:09.993 --> 00:02:13.516
At last it was Emmy's turn.

28
00:02:13.517 --> 00:02:19.442
She carried her violin onto the stage.

29
00:02:19.443 --> 00:02:31.020
She was very nervous.

30
00:02:31.021 --> 00:02:39.447
Emmy played her song perfectly!

31
00:02:39.448 --> 00:02:45.684
Everyone clapped.

32
00:02:45.685 --> 00:02:49.657
"We're so proud of you!" Mom said.

33
00:02:49.658 --> 00:02:52.026
Emmy smiled.

34
00:02:52.027 --> 00:02:58.468
"I'm glad I practiced a lot," she said.

35
00:02:58.469 --> 00:03:03.273
"Can I learn to play the drums, Dad?" Harry asked.

36
00:03:03.274 --> 00:03:08.472
"I'll practice every day!"

37
00:03:08.473 --> 00:03:13.945
Oliver groaned. "Oh no!

38
00:03:13.946 --> 00:03:24.583
Here we go again!"

